{%- comment -%}
  Zo Veilig — variant ids for cart lines that are not a product the customer chose from
  a product page: the Woning surcharge lines (NAMI and Climax) and the add-on lines (Videodeurbel,
  Afstandsbediening, the per-package Ontzorgpakket products, the Koop add-ons and the camera
  subscription rider). Shared by zv-header.liquid, zv-cart.liquid
  and the add-to-cart drawer in oplossingen.liquid, so every "N artikelen"/cart-count
  display agrees on what counts as a visible line.

  Deliberately self-contained (does NOT include zv-pricing): zv-pricing.liquid also
  prints a <script id="zv-pricing-config"> JSON blob, and zv-header.liquid renders on
  every page, including ones whose own section already includes zv-pricing (Oplossingen,
  the cart page) — including it here too would duplicate that script tag/id on those
  pages. The Woning handle/SKU come from the generated zv-package-handles.liquid
  (line: 'woning'; render, not include — it only echoes text, no script tag, so it's
  safe sitewide), so pricing.config.json stays their only source and check_pricing.py's
  "no theme file names the Woning product" guard holds. The Ontzorgpakket handles come from
  the same generated snippet (line: 'ontzorg', 2026-10-27). The Videodeurbel/Afstandsbediening
  handles stay hardcoded literals, mirroring zv-cart.liquid and oplossingen.liquid (not
  covered by that guard); if they ever change, update this file too.

  activation_variant_id is resolved here too for convenience (both existing callers
  already need it for their own row display) but it is NOT excluded from any count —
  the Climax activation line is counted everywhere, matching the add-to-cart drawer's
  existing behaviour (cartRowHtml in oplossingen.liquid always renders it as its own
  row; only Woning/add-on lines are merged into their package line there).

  Include this (not render — callers need these as their own variables).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign activation_variant_id = all_products['climax-instalatie'].selected_or_first_available_variant.id -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Woning lines (one product per platform since 2026-10-27, NAMI and Climax), resolved by
  zv-woning-variants into woning_variant_ids (pipe string, 0 for an unresolved product, for data
  attributes) and woning_variant_id_list (strings, for `contains item_vid` checks).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture zv_hidden_woning_handles -%}{% render 'zv-package-handles', line: 'woning', what: 'handles' %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture zv_hidden_woning_skus -%}{% render 'zv-package-handles', line: 'woning', what: 'skus' %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture woning_variant_ids -%}{%- render 'zv-woning-variants', handles: zv_hidden_woning_handles, skus: zv_hidden_woning_skus -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign woning_variant_ids = woning_variant_ids | strip -%}
{%- assign woning_variant_id_list = woning_variant_ids | split: '|' -%}
{%- assign zv_addon_videodeurbel_variant_id = all_products['huur-video-deurbel-750'].variants.first.id -%}
{%- assign zv_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id = all_products['huur-afstandsbediening'].variants.first.id -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Ontzorgpakket per package (2026-10-27): every Ontzorgpakket product's variant id, as a string
  array (zv_ontzorg_variant_id_list) for `contains item_vid` checks, where item_vid is
  item.variant_id | append: '' (a number never matches a string in contains), and as a pipe
  string (zv_ontzorg_variant_ids) for data attributes.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture zv_hidden_ontzorg_handles -%}{% render 'zv-package-handles', line: 'ontzorg', what: 'handles' %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign zv_ontzorg_variant_ids = '' -%}
{%- assign zv_hidden_ontzorg_list = zv_hidden_ontzorg_handles | strip | split: '|' -%}
{%- for h in zv_hidden_ontzorg_list -%}
  {%- assign ov = all_products[h].variants.first.id -%}
  {%- if ov != blank -%}{%- assign zv_ontzorg_variant_ids = zv_ontzorg_variant_ids | append: '|' | append: ov -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- assign zv_ontzorg_variant_ids = zv_ontzorg_variant_ids | remove_first: '|' -%}
{%- assign zv_ontzorg_variant_id_list = zv_ontzorg_variant_ids | split: '|' -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Koop add-on lines (Huren/Kopen, 2026-10-24): Videodeurbel's Koop product ADC-750 and
  Afstandsbediening's CL004, both by handle (2026-10-27; there is no Koop setting for either any
  more). syncAddonLines() on Oplossingen keeps them at quantity 1 and the drawer hides them like
  the huur add-ons. 0 when unresolved, so it never matches a line.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign zv_koop_addon_videodeurbel_variant_id = all_products['koop-video-deurbel-750'].variants.first.id | plus: 0 -%}
{%- assign zv_koop_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id = all_products['koop-afstandsbediening'].variants.first.id | plus: 0 -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Rider lines (2026-10-27): the camera subscription that rides with a bought Videodeurbel,
  by handle from the generated zv-package-handles (line: 'rider'). Hidden like the add-ons:
  zv_rider_variant_ids (pipe string) and zv_rider_variant_id_list (strings, for `contains`).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture zv_hidden_rider_handles -%}{% render 'zv-package-handles', line: 'rider', what: 'handles' %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign zv_rider_variant_ids = '' -%}
{%- assign zv_hidden_rider_list = zv_hidden_rider_handles | strip | split: '|' -%}
{%- for h in zv_hidden_rider_list -%}
  {%- assign rv = all_products[h].variants.first.id -%}
  {%- if rv != blank -%}{%- assign zv_rider_variant_ids = zv_rider_variant_ids | append: '|' | append: rv -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- assign zv_rider_variant_ids = zv_rider_variant_ids | remove_first: '|' -%}
{%- assign zv_rider_variant_id_list = zv_rider_variant_ids | split: '|' -%}
